WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:04.713
Thanks.

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:08.466
You don't need a bag just for milk!

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.093
They put it in one.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:13.304
Just say no! Pour me some, too.

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:15.265
Dad, want some barley tea?

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:18.601
Please... I'll come over.

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:23.231
-Thanks. Is the word processor open?
-I'm still printing.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:26.818
I should buy an electronic notebook.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:29.863
You smoke too much.

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:32.490
You could've gone to your aunt's, too.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:35.368
No. Shiho wears me out.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:38.371
Oh, I've got work tomorrow.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:39.914
Do you need lunch?

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:41.708
No, I'll eat out.

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:45.795
The library's busy updating
to a barcode system.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.882
I like the checkout cards better.

00:00:49.924 --> 00:00:51.426
Me, too.

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:53.887
Hey, this isn't right...

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.263
What?

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:58.892
Did you leave out a line?

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.561
You're right!

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:05.148
Let me go first. I have to get this right
or my professor will complain.

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.693
SEIJI AMASAWA - JULY 5TH

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:10.487
This guy...

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.324
You can read, but don't stay up too late.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:15.575
Good night.

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:27.796
I thought I'd seen that name before...

00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:31.674
Here, too...

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.635
LIBRARY WITHDRAWAL CARD

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.804
SEIJI AMASAWA - JULY 27TH

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:37.722
SEIJI AMASAWA - JULY 28TH

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:38.932
SEIJI AMASAWA - JULY 5TH

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:42.936
He's taken all these books out before me.

00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:55.907
Seiji Amasawa... What's he like?
Wonder if he's nice.

